<includeonly>{{#invoke:ObbyGameInfobox|main}}</includeonly><noinclude>
<code>{{Tl|ObbyGameInfobox}}</code> is a large and complex template (which invokes [[Module:ObbyGameInfobox]]). Please refer to the below documentation about how each parameter is used.

Please note that only the <code>root_place_id</code> and <code>name</code> parameters are truly required for an ideal template. Most information is automatically fetched based on the place id. The root place id should be the number/id in the url when you open the game.
<pre>{{ObbyGameInfobox
| name* = {{PAGENAME}}
| image = thumbnail.webp
| root_place_id* = PLACE ID HERE AS NUMBER
| developer = DEVELOPER NAME HERE (will be used as a fallback)
| publisher = PUBLISHER (remove field if inapplicable, i.e., the game is self-published)
| subgenre = <string> - see list of supported sub-genres and shorthands in the sub-genres help page listed below
| system = <string> - (defaults to N/A)
| maturity = <string> - only: minimal, na, unrated/none, mild, mature, restricted
| year = <number> - 20xx ''(will only be valid if at or above 2008 and below or at the current year or up to 2 years ahead)''
| month = <number> - 1-12 only
| stages = <number>
| stages_total = <number> - the total stages planned (if known)
| difficulties = <number>
| difficulties_total = <number> - the total difficulties planned (if known)
| towers = <number>
| towers_total = <number> - the total towers planned (if known)
| avatar_type = <string> - r6, r15, rthro, choice

| verified = <true|false|broken|does_not_load> - do not include if unsure
| ai = <branding|thumbnails|icon|identity|stated_none|description|unknown> - ignore for blank/unknown
| is_public = <boolean>
| unreleased = <boolean>

| visits = <number> - (automatically set)
| likes = <number> - (automatically set)
| dislikes = <number> - (automatically set)
| peak_ccu = <number>

| twitter = <string> - e.g., Username (not @Username)
| bsky = <string> - e.g., _.bsky.social
| youtube = <string>
| roblox = <string> - e.g, Username (not @Username)
| discord = <string> - code only
| guilded = <string> - code only, deprecated
| website = <string> - do not include protocol, supports only https
| wiki = obbywiki.com/wiki/Obby

| pc = true
| tablet = true
| phone = true
| vr = true
| console = true
}}</pre>

